      "original_position": 1,
      "content": "[Mon 2026-09-07 12:49 GMT+8] 请使用中文回复，除非用户明确使用其他语言。\n\n麻烦给我一份企业雇佣兼职人员的兼职合同，适用于媒体、广告业。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_f7ae916abc7a:36b8724d",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 37943,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 2,
      "content": "好的，我来为您起草一份适用于媒体、广告业的企业兼职人员劳务/劳动合同。先看一下文档工具，然后直接给您生成一份可编辑的 Word 合同文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_f7ae916abc7a:bfb27c8b",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 37944,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 3,
      "content": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_f7ae916abc7a:756ff1f2",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 37945,
      "source_file": "messages",
      "copy_kind": "trusted",
      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 4,
      "content": "收到，正在为您起草一份**《非全日制用工劳动合同（兼职）》**——这是法律上规范的\"兼职雇佣\"形式，条款会针对媒体/广告行业特点（创意成果版权、保密、按项目交付等）做专门设计。先生成文档。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_f7ae916abc7a:78ec125e",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 37946,
